T-Hist 1.7.0 History Utility - Mailer load statistics
Creates  statistics  based  on  mailer's  binary logs
Supported mailers: Binkd, qico 0.60.2+, T-Mail, Argus,
Internet Rex,  Bink/+, FhMail,  KittenMail, The Brake!
BinkleyTerm-XE, DVMmail, XMail32, BasicMail. Copyright
